{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"bones shakes awake \"damnit i need to not nod off so much. be tude to interrupt her sleeping, i'll leave a note.\" he composes a letter\n\n|| Meorys,\nit's been some time but there's been bad blood between us over kate since that hunt. Her cries still haunt me. I know I wasn't able to see the last exchange through to the end so i don't want to hold any ill for any changes from you after you hurt her. I'm willing to forgive if you can tell me that this won't happen again. Kids are welcome to the consequences of their choices, but she didn't choose this. You've since shown that you're a fine mechanic and part of a good team on this fine ship. i don't know if we'll be able to talk in person with this war around us, but i had to say something. \n\ntake care,\n~~andr~~ bones ||","created_at":"2021-08-06T16:08:11.483000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"873236021570043965","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
