{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Irynx finally gets out of bed, stretches. She summons Orphy back from wherever he's been wandering, and have a quiet catch up over whatever he's been listening in on.\n\nShe arranges her stuff, leaving the spear against the wall with the rapier, and merges into her raven. Irynx heads out to the central living space.","created_at":"2021-08-17T03:29:54.011000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877031457862848523","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"866825622390702090","created_at":"2021-07-29T16:33:20.331000Z","id":"870343247212453929","name":"irynxs-quarters"},"thread_id":"870343247212453929"}
