{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Iryne and Orphy arrive on deck of the ship, and partake in their usual ritual of conversation when they've been left alone.","created_at":"2021-08-19T11:35:19.088000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877878393021018153","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"It all passes quietly between them, as it always does, but Orphy speaks up. `You think they'll be okay?`\n\nIt surprises her, catches in the middle of thought. Then again, her familiar knows how she feels about putting those thoughts into words and speaking them out loud.\n\nShe sighs. \"No. I don't think anyone will be okay for a while.\"\n\n`Then let's think about that.`","created_at":"2021-08-19T11:44:48.506000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877880781333200906","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"A knock sounds out by the door of the airship.","created_at":"2021-08-19T11:56:46.334000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877883792122081291","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Slight staring contest between a warlock and her familiar.\n\n`Miss, I don't know what you're aiming to do here but only one of us is actually capable of opening that door. And don't you think of turning into a raven, because it's not gonna change what I can and can't do.`","created_at":"2021-08-19T11:59:42.629000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-19T11:59:55.689000Z","id":"877884531556896798","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Irynx rolls her eyes and simply yells, hopefully loud enough to be heard outside on deck. \"We don't lock it!\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:00:31.536000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877884736687702026","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"`Yes we do! Just not right now!`","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:02:07.408000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877885138804015135","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"The Speaker takes in a deep breath and slowly opens the door. He enters into the ship, his pace deliberately slow. \"Greetings...\" The speaker pauses, not sure how to address the other person here. \".. priestess.\" He says with a deep bow.","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:02:57.555000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877885349135790090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Irynx's posture goes stiff, her expression unreadable. Orphy hops up on the table, then to the opposite seat. `Sit down and sit down straight. We're listening.`","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:07:05.851000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877886390564696084","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"The Speaker shuffles awkwardly into the ship, closing the door behind him. \"Recent events made me prioritize things yet again.\" The speaker says with a cough. \"The mass burial reminded me that we are indeed in a war and no amount of brooding from me will fix that.\" He looks straight towards Irynx. \"I am not asking to be friends nor am I asking for your forgiveness. I am here so that the ball-eater may serve in the war effort. A pilot may not be able to fly an airship alone, but an airship without a pilot will not fly at all. We need to do all we can to stop this violence, I want to do all I can so that no more deaths happen.\" The speaker says while the memory of Trapero's funeral is fresh in his mind.","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:12:54.886000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877887854523596850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Irynx takes a deep breath and sighs.","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:13:55.900000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877888110434861076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Everything I wanted to tell you, everything I prepared for when we would inevitably meet again, I used it all.\" She smiles wryly. \"To Prosser, just a few hours ago. They got the lines I prepared for you. So, I'm sorry if it's hard for me to talk to you right now. I usually have things to say. I usually have time to think.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:19:20.623000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-19T12:24:16.117000Z","id":"877889472421838848","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"She and Orphy share a look, shuffling papers around in her mind, trying to determine a script for this conversation where she no longer has what she's been preparing.","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:22:49.452000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877890348314140763","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"After a while, she looks back at the kobold.","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:26:09.445000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877891187145584690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I never really stopped seeing you as a friend, you know. That's a difficult thing to change. But I'm not a fool.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:26:52.901000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877891369413251102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"You were going down a direction that I disagreed with. You kept going, and so I cut you out.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:27:40.084000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877891567313121320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"So I guess, what I want to say is, how have you been? How has this time treated you?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:28:08.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877891687677063169","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"The speaker sighs, slightly shocked as to the casualness of Irynx's words. \"I've been doing relatively fine. I've spent some time learning, about myself and my mistakes.\" \n\"I'm thankful that you still think of me as a friend. I fucked up, I got caught up in my own feelings and my own world that I ignored what you, and other people, actually needed. I tried my best to be the one you can rely on, because deep down I wanted to rely on myself... I wanted to know myself... And I defaulted on \"Irynx's friend\". But that's not how identity works, my framework on who I am shouldn't hinge on someone else. That's too much responsibility on your side and not enough agency on mine. I see that now, and I've been trying to be better, truly.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:33:21.140000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877892997805645884","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"And now the answer I have to the question \"who am I?\" is that I am a person fighting in a war for this country. And this person is a trained pilot. And that's why I've come.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:34:53.030000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877893383220260905","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"That's... more wisdom than I expected from you, all honesty.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:35:12.479000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877893464795283476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I am flattered.\" The speaker says with a small smile.","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:35:28.319000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877893531233030174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I said this to Prosser, since it was appropriate then, but I did mean it for you.\" She wrings her fingers.\n\n\"Loneliness comes from not having yourself. You are not lonely because you have no one with you, but because you do not have yourself.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:36:42.635000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877893842936946689","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I don't think you understand how much of a problem it was to me, Speaker, to see you give up your name, your identity, the very things that made you 'you'.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:37:21.871000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-19T12:37:26.798000Z","id":"877894007504650270","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"It was your truth, the substance of your life, and you were so free to give it away.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:40:01.275000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877894676093485106","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I understand it now. I gave those things away with a foolish smile on my naive face because I never knew how much they meant. But you know how the saying goes, you don't know how much a thing means to you until it's gone. I was lonely, and I tried to fill in thay gap with your presence, and thought your presence would be enough. Now I understand how that's not good.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:40:05.682000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-19T12:42:45.918000Z","id":"877894694577774663","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I had to learn somehow right?\" The Speaker tries for a weak chuckle.","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:40:30.540000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877894798839787541","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"`Hey, that's my line.`\n\n`Right. Going back to quiet Orphy.`","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:40:58.035000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877894914162188290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"So... who you are, is a trained pilot fighting in a war for Arcania.\"\n\n\"That's not a good enough answer.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:52:41.998000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877897866797006928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Because I don't have an answer yet. Nor do I wish to have one. In a world where change is everywhere do we really need one definite answer to who we are?\" The speaker shakes his head. \"I'm okay with finding out who I am at the present moment so that I know what do at the present moment. Right now I'm a pilot fighting in a war. But that doesn't mean that's all I am or all I ever will be. It just means that this is the me that I think is the most important to be.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:55:44.755000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877898633335427132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"That sounded a bit too complicated and weird, but I think you get what I'm trying to say.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T12:56:13.798000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877898755150577664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Gods, half the impact of what I wanted to say is lost since I gave them to Prosser.\"\n\nShe slaps her cheeks a few times then looks back at the Speaker.\n\n\"I have changed. Over eight centuries, I simply can't be the person I was when I was born. But once I am buried, and the trees drink my body, I know they will taste the ocean. Through all my changes, that is my truth.\"\n\n\"When you meet your end, what do you think the trees will taste?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T13:01:56.028000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-19T13:11:45.324000Z","id":"877900190567243808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Hopefully, someone who can say they were happy with their life. That's all I want. To be happy with myself no matter who that self is.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T13:03:46.477000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877900653823926312","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Then don't define yourself with war, Speaker. It's sad and heartbreaking and ugly.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T13:05:52.020000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877901180389445682","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"It's ugly and sad yes, but it's happening right now wether we like it or not. It wouldn't do good to ignore it. After the war's over, then I'll define myself as something other than someone fighting a war. Right now though, I am.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T13:07:54.572000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-19T13:09:11.220000Z","id":"877901694409789461","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Don't lose yourself in war, soldier. After this war, there may be another. I only hope the trees won't taste it on you when you're buried.\"\n\n\"But you're on a good path, and for that I am happy.\"\n\nShe merges into a raven, and heads towards the golden birdcage on the other side of the room. She steps inside, along with Orphy, and vanishes into <#870343247212453929>.","created_at":"2021-08-19T13:16:54.454000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877903958839021618","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
